OL,3,AGermany's Merz warns attackers will
OL,4,A'pay price' after drone incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FGerman Chancellor Friedrich Merz has
OL,7,Fwarned that those responsible for drone
OL,8,Fattacks and other hostile acts against
OL,9,FGermany, including a recent case at
OL,10,FLeipzig Airport, would "pay a price".
OL,12,FMerz said the incident showed Germany
OL,13,Fwas "facing a very real threat" and was
OL,14,Fincreasingly becoming a target.
OL,16,FOn 4 August, a drone carrying an
OL,17,Fexplosive device was discovered at
OL,18,FLeipzig/Halle Airport in eastern
OL,19,FGermany, close to Ukrainian cargo
OL,20,Fplanes. However, it failed to explode
OL,21,Fas the detonator was apparently faulty.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
