OL,3,AGermany's Merz warns attackers will
OL,4,A'pay price' after drone incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice defused the explosives and
OL,7,Fbelieve a second drone may have
OL,8,Fcollided with a cargo aircraft nearby.
OL,9,FSecurity experts have speculated that
OL,10,FRussia may have been responsible.
